      ],
      "content": "LITTLE GADDESDEN       \tRINGSHALL SP 91 SE    \t\t\t\t\t(West side)                                     1/214                                   \tNos. 12 and 13 - GV                                      \tII House, now 2 houses. Probably C17, altered in C18/early C19 to 2 estate houses. Timber frame brick cased with half-hipped old red tile roofs and rear outshuts. Shared internal stack. 2 storeys block facing E with 2 casement windows to each floor and segmental arches. Boarded door. Gabled porch to No. 13 and window on S end to road. (Senar(1983)59). Listing NGR: SP9842614281"
    }
  ],
